        question: "Passage: \"In recent years, researchers have investigated how artificial intelligence can assist doctors in identifying diseases. AI systems can analyze large amounts of medical information and detect patterns that may be difficult for humans to recognize. However, medical experts emphasize that these tools are most effective when combined with human judgment rather than replacing doctors entirely. As AI technology continues to develop, researchers are exploring ways to improve collaboration between computers and healthcare professionals.\"\n\nWhich choice best states the main idea of the passage?",
