        choices: ["After months of saving money she finally purchased a larger telescope however learning to use it proved much more difficult than she expected.", "After months of saving money, she finally purchased a larger telescope. However, learning to use it proved much more difficult than she expected.", "After months of saving money; she finally purchased a larger telescope, however learning to use it proved much more difficult than she expected.", "After months of saving money, however she finally purchased a larger telescope learning to use it proved much more difficult than she expected."],
        answer: 1,
